Wh... What's this?!

00:18:42.500 --> 00:18:45.980
I've bought them as you requested; cigarettes and ice-cream.

00:18:45.980 --> 00:18:47.520
Ice-creams, ten of 'em.

00:18:47.520 --> 00:18:49.380
What?!

00:18:49.380 --> 00:18:53.030
Oh, my... Are you playing with me, Kasuga?

00:18:59.320 --> 00:19:02.150
W...Wait a minute, Kasuga! What're you doing?!

00:19:09.630 --> 00:19:11.090
Kasuga...

00:19:11.690 --> 00:19:18.220
A...Ayukawa... I want you to let me...
take nude photos of you.

00:19:18.770 --> 00:19:20.260
What?!

00:19:20.260 --> 00:19:24.470
Okay. Please take off your clothes now.

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:28.720
H...Hey, Kasuga! What's going on?!

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:32.320
You got me ice-creams that I didn't ask for...
Ten of them to boot!

00:19:32.320 --> 00:19:35.980
And the cigarettes... You were
the one who told me to quit smoking!

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:41.280
"Get me a pack of cigarettes."

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:42.850
"Ice-cream! Ten of 'em!"

00:19:42.850 --> 00:19:45.900
"You will go and take
nude photos of Ayukawa!"

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:51.590
Nude pictures of A... Ayukawa...

00:19:57.140 --> 00:20:00.080
Fine... I'll take my clothes off,
but you'd better take good pictures!

00:20:19.430 --> 00:20:22.410
Fine. If he's trying to play games with me...

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:24.190
...then I'm gonna do the same!

00:20:28.040 --> 00:20:32.340
What?! Oh, geez... Is... Is he serious?!

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:41.780
W... Wait a sec... He's not himself today!

00:20:52.900 --> 00:20:55.860
That's... it for today!

00:20:58.300 --> 00:21:01.530
If you don't stop...
you're gonna be really sorry!

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:08.140
Geez! Knock it off!

00:21:35.670 --> 00:21:38.640
Please take off your clothes.

00:21:40.280 --> 00:21:44.000
Madoka! Madoka!

00:21:44.000 --> 00:21:48.070
Madoka! Is my Oniichan inside?

00:21:48.070 --> 00:21:51.120
Yo, Kyosuke! Come out!

00:21:53.660 --> 00:21:57.250
What?! Are you telling me that he was hypnotized?!

00:21:57.560 --> 00:21:58.110
Yup!

00:21:58.110 --> 00:22:01.680
Well, but, even so,
he didn't get me my cigarettes...

00:22:01.680 --> 00:22:06.220
I told you, I ordered him to
get me ice-cream right after that!

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:09.860
What does that mean?!

00:22:09.860 --> 00:22:11.550
In short, you see...

00:22:11.550 --> 00:22:13.960
He returns to normal after receiving...

00:22:13.960 --> 00:22:17.030
...more than two instructions at once, since that would cause confusion!

00:22:17.030 --> 00:22:19.030
What?! "B...Back to normal...?!"

00:22:19.030 --> 00:22:20.280
That's right!

00:22:20.280 --> 00:22:22.310
Completely back to his normal state!
That's right!

00:22:22.310 --> 00:22:22.400
That's right!

00:22:22.400 --> 00:22:24.870
But then, I really wonder, where did he go?

00:22:24.870 --> 00:22:24.990
Uh-huh!

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:26.780
We thought he'd be here though...
Uh-huh!

00:22:26.780 --> 00:22:26.870
Uh-huh!

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:30.390
That's strange... Maybe he's gone back home?

00:22:30.830 --> 00:22:33.780
Oh? What's with Madoka?

00:22:33.780 --> 00:22:36.330
Could I get another drink?

00:22:40.200 --> 00:22:43.310
W...Well...er...

00:22:43.310 --> 00:22:46.360
Well, er...

00:22:46.360 --> 00:22:49.380
A...Ayukawa...

00:22:53.450 --> 00:22:55.690
I know it's hard to believe, but...

00:22:55.690 --> 00:22:58.360
...before I realized it, I found myself here.

00:22:58.360 --> 00:23:01.600
Er, in other words, I was unconscious so...

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:05.960
I'm not saying that I don't remember everything that I did, but still...

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:16.960
Unforgivable...!

00:23:16.960 --> 00:23:20.550
Maybe I... was pushing my luck a bit too far...

00:23:20.550 --> 00:23:25.570
...or so I, Kasuga Kyosuke, pondered...

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:40.490
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.490 --> 00:23:44.750
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:49.080
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:53.320
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.320 --> 00:24:01.200
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.200 --> 00:24:10.700
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:18.510
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.510 --> 00:24:27.190
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.190 --> 00:24:36.900
You were waiting for the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.900 --> 00:24:45.270
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.270 --> 00:24:49.610
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.610 --> 00:24:53.950
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:53.950 --> 00:24:58.250
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.250 --> 00:25:02.590
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.590 --> 00:25:07.410
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:12.660 --> 00:25:15.900
Oh, no! I carelessly used my Power...

00:25:15.900 --> 00:25:18.100
...right in front of Komatsu and Hatta!

00:25:18.100 --> 00:25:21.180
The guys are determined to shoot a movie about my powers...

00:25:21.180 --> 00:25:23.250
...and so they've come after me
with a camera...

00:25:23.250 --> 00:25:26.110
...and even let Hikaru take part in it!

00:25:26.110 --> 00:25:30.470
Next time: "Adios Kyosuke!
Paranormal Powers Caught on Video!"
